# 1. THE PRODUCT VISION

SYNMOTION AI is an AI-powered creative production environment designed to make professional 3D animation and cinematic filmmaking dramatically easier.

The ambition is to combine the creative capabilities and workflows associated with:

* Unreal Engine 5.
* Blender.
* Autodesk Maya.
* Cinema 4D.
* DaVinci Resolve.
* Adobe After Effects.
* Professional virtual production studios.

Reimagine those capabilities around an intelligent AI Director that understands natural language, scenes, characters, environments, animation, cinematography, and storytelling.

The application should allow someone with no 3D experience to create sophisticated animation.

It should also provide enough control for experienced animators, filmmakers, and technical artists to work at a professional level.

